+# Version Scheme
+
+This project has no current recorded decision documenting its version numbering scheme. Release version strings (e.g. `v1.12.0`, as seen in `version.go` and `CHANGELOG.md`) exist, but no policy, ADR, or other document in this repository defines, names, or adopts a specific numbering convention for them.
